    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48426" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tissē</span></b> , ēs,
			f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a little town in Sicily</i>, now <i>Randazzo</i>, <i><span class="en">Sil. 14, 267</span></i>.—Hence,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tis-senses</span></b> ,
				ĭum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Tisse</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 3, 38, § 86</span></i>; for
			which: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tis-sinenses</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 8,
				14, § 91</span></i>.</div>
